Adventurer,

The Albion East Closed Beta is now underway, and a new Dev Talk is here! Ah=
ead of the launch of the new *Albion East* ( https://albiononline.com/asia =
) server, our Game Director discusses what this means for Albion, the Close=
d Beta, and what the playing experience will be like.

Click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/devtalk-albion-east ) to read =
a summary, or watch it here:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DefCTzcsH1aQ )

In addition to a fresh version of Albion's game world and unique rewards, p=
articipating in the Closed Beta gives the forthcoming *Arcanist Wardrobe an=
d Mount Skin Bundle* free to all characters on your account, before its off=
icial release!

This bundle not only makes you stand out during beta, but can be used on Al=
bion West immediately and Albion East after launch - so you can stand out o=
n both servers.

( https://albiononline.com/asia#founderpacks )

Get a Founder Pack and join the Closed Beta starting February 20!

